_evo-output/implementation-artifacts/

# GeoIP runtime artifacts — generated by scripts/download-geodb.sh and the
# geolocation-refresh sidecar. The .mmdb (DB-IP Lite/Full, MaxMind GeoLite2),
# the .tmp staging copies, the intermediate .gz download, and the transient
# geoipupdate config all live here. Refreshed monthly per host; must never
# be committed (size + license: DB-IP Lite is CC-BY but Full and MaxMind
# explicitly forbid redistribution). The .gitkeep preserves the directory
# shape so the docker-compose bind mount has a target on a fresh clone.
data/geo/*
!data/geo/.gitkeep